# The composer over an artifact: a light artifact scrolled to its end with a draft of several lines,
# a narrow and an expanded desk, a step to production, an artifact no ask links, and the way back
# to the ask.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
replies ask-artifact-float.json
project storefront shop
patch ask-artifact-float.diff
chat Wren
title "Autumn prices"
say "Show me the autumn prices."
settle 10
chat Juno
title "Prices live"
say "Get ready to put the prices live."
settle 10
chat Nami
title "Prices today"
say "Show me what we charge."
settle 10
front Nami
settle 2
click 1083,69
settle 4
snap ask-artifact-none
front Juno
settle 2
click 1083,69
settle 4
snap ask-artifact-gate
front Wren
settle 2
click 1083,69
settle 4
snap ask-artifact-light
click 860,802
settle 1
type "The walnut board at 62 is what people buy it for. Keep it there until the new boards come in, and tell me what they cost us first." 200
settle 2
snap ask-artifact-draft
click 1092,63
settle 3
snap ask-artifact-light-wide
click 917,99
settle 3
snap ask-artifact-back
